  "title": "Join us on Friday, September 25th, 2026 for our next session of the Public Webinar Series!",
  "bodyHtml": "<p>? From Genes to Mechanisms: AI-Assisted Discovery across the Data Distillery Knowledge Graph</p><p>? Attendees will learn how to:</p><ol><li>Connect genetics to biology: Trace genes, regulatory variants, phenotypes, and disease associations across pathways, tissues, cellular contexts, and model-organism evidence using the Data Distillery Knowledge Graph (DDKG).</li><li>Ask biological questions more easily: See how ddkg.skill enables general-purpose AI assistants to translate research questions into reproducible DDKG graph queries—without requiring deep knowledge of the graph’s underlying structure.</li><li>Move toward testable mechanisms: Learn how integrated biomedical evidence and AI-assisted exploration can help researchers move beyond genetic associations to identify candidate pathways, biological mechanisms, and hypotheses for further investigation.</li></ol><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px 0px 10px;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">? September 25, 2026</p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin:0px 0px 10px;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">⏰ 1-2 PM ET</p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-c